## 🔗 Joining Data

| 🛠️ Command | 💻 Syntax | 📖 Definition |
|------------|-----------|---------------|
| `join()` | `df1.join(df2,"EmpID","inner")` | Joins two DataFrames. |
| `union()` | `df1.union(df2)` | Combines rows. |
| `unionByName()` | `df1.unionByName(df2)` | Combines rows by matching column names. |

