## ⚡ Performance Optimization

| 🛠️ Command | 💻 Syntax | 📖 Definition |
|------------|-----------|---------------|
| `cache()` | `df.cache()` | Stores data in memory. |
| `persist()` | `df.persist()` | Stores data using a storage level. |
| `unpersist()` | `df.unpersist()` | Removes cached data. |
| `repartition()` | `df.repartition(10)` | Redistributes partitions. |
| `coalesce()` | `df.coalesce(2)` | Reduces partitions efficiently. |
| `checkpoint()` | `df.checkpoint()` | Breaks lineage for fault tolerance. |
| `explain()` | `df.explain()` | Displays execution plan. |

